      "source_xml_line": 423,
      "string_id": "dialogs_escape_140",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "No, he just never poked his nose into other people's affairs.",
      "JA_current": "No, he just never poked his nose into other people's affairs.",
      "JA_new": "いや、他人のことに首を突っ込まなかっただけさ。",
